房"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-n8vx8a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-n8vx8a4","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MìFēnɡFánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-leibkn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-leibkn5","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】蜜蜂窠、蜜脾、蜜蜂巢脾"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-jnk0coa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-jnk0coa","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-16hfg9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-16hfg9a","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蜜蜂科动物中华蜜蜂等的巢。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-x1lmjfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-x1lmjfj","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：ApisceranaFabr."}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-gspkpen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-gspkpen","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：随采鲜用，或秋末采收，略蒸，煎开，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-bhy2488","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-bhy2488","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-egxt008","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-egxt008","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.中华蜜蜂，蜂群由工蜂、蜂王及雄蜂组成。工蜂全体被黄褐色毛。头略呈三角形。胸部3节。翅2对，膜质透明。足3对，有采集花粉的构造。腹部圆锥状，有毒腺和螫针。腹下有蜡板4对，内有蜡腺，分泌蜡质。蜂王体最大，翅短小，腹部特长，生殖器发达，专营生殖产卵。雄蜂较工蜂稍大，头呈球形，尾无毒腺和螫针，足上无采贮花粉构造，腹无蜡板及蜡腺。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-nabhoae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-nabhoae","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.意大利蜜蜂，体似中华蜜蜂，但较之为大。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-5luwq5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-5luwq5h","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】我国大部分地区均有养殖。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-keev2mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-keev2mo","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味微甘；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-h9cmkxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-h9cmkxh","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解毒消肿；祛风杀虫。主疮痈肿毒；咽痛咳嗽；慢性鼻炎；鼻窦炎；湿疹瘙痒；疮癣"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-8os1o6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-8os1o6e","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：咀嚼吮汁，1-5g；或烧存性冲，3-5g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902173925-8hs1iqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173925-8hs1iqj","updated":"20240902173931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902173926-vsd59aa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902173926-vsd59aa","updated":"20240902173931"}},{"ID":"20240902173927-q04qqf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902173927-q04qqf5","updated":"20240902173931"}}]}